// The configuration tools/preload_check.py gives markdownlint (markdownlint-cli2) for
// artefacts/specification-prose/ when the instance has no .markdownlint* or .markdownlint-cli2*
// file of its own at its root (task-0082): markdownlint's default rules, less the two that judge
// layout rather than form, line length (MD013) and table column style (MD060). Copy it to your
// instance root as .markdownlint.jsonc to tune it; that one then applies instead.
{
  "default": true,
  "MD013": false,
  "MD060": false
}
